    <p class="lead">I’m Thibauld Croonenborghs, a Data Architect at AE working across data platforms, architecture and engineering.</p>
    <p>My path started at the Belgian Royal Military Academy. I worked as an army officer for several years while studying computer science, then moved into software and data.</p>
    <p>Today I build across Microsoft Fabric, Azure, Hadoop and Databricks, with a particular enthusiasm for Python and Spark. I also speak about the practical side of data engineering: performance, architecture, testing and choosing the right tool for the job.</p>
